            :outcomes "previewed/checked/applied/rolled-back exit 0; denied 2; unavailable 3; failed-restored 4; held 5. On known prewrite selection denial report observed before=after; when observation/effects are unknown, held after:null and target_writes:null are unknown, not absence or zero. Preserve first failure; no automatic clear, force, retry or fallback. Facade transport failure returns held/unknown."
